sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Producer as Producer<br/>(CLI / SDK / agent)
    participant Storage as Trunks Storage<br/>(shared Backend)
    participant Executor as Executor<br/>(daemon or execute)
    participant Sandbox as Sandbox<br/>(local / Docker / Daytona)

    Producer->>Storage: write commit closure<br/>objects + branch refs
    Producer->>Storage: CAS queue ref<br/>refs/actions/repos/<repo>/queue/<spec-key>/<route-bucket>/<shard>/<run>
    Producer-->>Producer: return run handle

    Executor->>Storage: scan assigned queue shards
    Executor->>Storage: CAS claim capacity slot<br/>refs/actions/pools/<pool>/capacity/<region>/<spec-key>/slots/<n>
    Executor->>Storage: CAS claim run state<br/>pending -> running
    Executor->>Sandbox: create sandbox from Spec
    Executor->>Sandbox: hydrate commit
    Sandbox->>Storage: read commit objects<br/>(token scoped when enabled)
    Executor->>Sandbox: run command

    loop while running
        Sandbox-->>Executor: log chunk
        Executor->>Storage: write log ref<br/>runs/<run>/logs/<attempt>/<seq>
        Executor->>Storage: heartbeat run lease + capacity slot
    end

    Executor->>Sandbox: collect artifacts
    Executor->>Storage: write artifact blobs + artifact refs
    Executor->>Storage: CAS complete run state
    Executor->>Storage: release capacity slot + queue ref
    Executor->>Sandbox: destroy sandbox

    Producer->>Storage: read logs/state/artifacts
    Storage-->>Producer: replayable result
